+Show the Config
+---------------
+
+The ``flask config`` command prints the application config as JSON. The value of
+any key containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN`` or ``KEY`` is replaced by
+``***``. ::
+
+    $ flask --app hello config
+
